{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47378","headline":"缑山庙 · 吴筠","name":"缑山庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝吾自嵩山，驱驾遵洛汭。\n逶迟轘辕侧，仰望缑山际。\n王子谢时人，笙歌此宾帝。\n仙材夙所禀，宝位焉足系。\n爲迫丹霄期，阙流苍生惠。\n高踪邈千载，遗庙今一诣。\n肃肃生风云，森森列松桂。\n大君弘至道，层构何壮丽。\n稽首环金坛，焚香陟瑶砌。\n伊余超浮俗，尘虑久已闭。\n况复清夙心，萧然叶真契。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}